onical document/log/data 中合法的嵌套同名字段当作 projection；增加 canonical revision 含合法 data.summary/compaction summary 时 sidecar 缺失、损坏和落后的回归，继续保证 normal list 不扫描历史 revision 或 decode document，canonical JSONL 是唯一事实源。审查 SQLite keyset 参数与新 cursor 合同保持一致，不实施 Stage 6 migration或兼容层。完成后运行受影响 Store/ACP v1/v2 测试和强制完整 scripts/verify-stage3.ps1，保持普通测试 offline/faux、不读取 .env、不调用真实 Provider；检查 generated/API/module/naming/secret/submodule/cleanup、git diff --check 和无残留进程。必要时同步权威文档/API baseline，创建单个本地 Conventional Commit，不 push、不建 PR，生成绑定最终 HEAD 的完整 Stage 3 验证附件。随后仅路由到 codex-acp、pf-builtin-accept 再次独立验收该修复；只有再验收 PASS 才允许进入 Stage 4。"},{"id":"assistant-thought-root-resp_02e108f77062df9f016a9b34fc311c87d0807e756986fc311f","kind":"thoughtDelta","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":2,"startedSeq":2,"endedSeq":2,"timestamp":"1788556546Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"**Updating task list and inspecting git status**"},{"id":"assistant-message-root-resp_02e108f77062df9f016a9b34fc311c87d0807e756986fc311f","kind":"textDelta","sessionId":"6c38ccdd-749d-49d7-b5f6-a264d537d17c","seq":153,"startedSeq":3,"endedSeq":153,"timestamp":"1788556546Z","raw":{"_meta":{"goldBandConversation":{"branchId":"root","toolName":null,"toolDetailAvailable":false}}},"content":"本轮只处理独立再验收确认的 cursor 绑定与 JSONL 顶层 summary 重建两个根因。先读取再验收证据、最新协调状态及权威规则，并审计 `af2154d` 后当前工作树；验证方式是先补共享 TCK/JSONL 稳定失败用例，再修复同一数据边界，运行 Store、ACP v1/v2 和完整 Stage 3 门禁，最后仅在全绿后提交及重建证据。主要取舍是不增加兼容 token 或第二 canonical store：cursor 显式版本化并绑定查询语义，sidecar 仍仅是从 canonical 末帧可重建的投影。"},{"id":"tool-call-call_INjZrfCLGQo02P2eEljLPrZP","kind":"toolCall","title":"grep | head -160 \"phase-3-fix-cursor-jsonl-rebuild|phase-3-reaccept-after-seven-blockers|\"groups\"\" /export/user\\.gold-band\\projects\\e-projects-code-ai-ji--a40d4379\\tasks\\task-015\\runs\\run-001\\rounds\\round-001\\nodes\\ai-dynamic\\attempt-001\\dynamic\\coordination-snapshot.json","status":"completed","to